\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  We love the place, O God,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Wherein Thine honour dwells;
\par The joy of Thine above
\par All earthly joy excels.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. It is the house of prayer,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Wherein Thy servants meet;
\par And Thou, O Lord, art there,\tab 
\par Thy chosen flock to greet.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We love the word of life,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The word that tells of peace,
\par Of comfort in the strife,
\par And joys that never cease.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  We love to sing below
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  For mercies freely given;
\par  But O we long to know
\par  The triumph song of heaven!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Lord Jesus, give us grace,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  On earth to love Thee more,
\par  In heaven to see Thy face,
\par \pard         And with Thy saints adore.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

